# Gate review, M-next C slice C3 (authority core)

**Verdict: APPROVE-WITH-NITS.** Read-only; no suites run, nothing edited (lanes/kondo/cljstyle green taken from the brief). The slice matches plan 1.1–1.5, 1.7, 1.10 and the C3 slice text; the boundary is clean; both doc edits are verbatim and correctly placed. The nits are two small test gaps and one latent authoring-side leniency — none block.

## Mutation pass by inspection (the attack the brief asked for)

Per guarantee, would a test go red if it were broken?

| Guarantee | Pinned by | Ruling |
|---|---|---|
