| Whole-decision serialization | `two-decisions-cannot-both-act-on-one-projection` (:289–302), JVM `future`s; engineer's mutation 1 went red (3 FAIL + 1 ERROR). Removing only *part* of the decision from the lock also goes red: a stale-projection enroll commits an enrolled fact whose identity names another t → fold `:foreign-target` → poison | Yes on JVM; Node/Dart serial by construction, honestly documented in `concurrently` (:279–286) |
